		0x0032,	 $ Descriptor
		4, 1,	$ Data Type, Data Size
		"Status #0",
		"",
		"Status of input channel.\nThis bit is the OR of all channel faults.\n\nPossible faults:\n - High & Low level alarms\n - Range Alarms\n - Open wire\n - Bad Calibration",
